      "text": {
        "jp": "そこにあるテレポストーンを使うといい。\r\n一瞬で街の各所を行き来できるぞ。",
        "official_en": "I would advise utilizing the Teleport Stone situated yonder to travel instantaneously to various points across the city.",
        "real_en": "You can use that Teleport Stone to travel between locations around the city in an instant."
