      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その代わりに\r\n氷のクリスタルに関しては教えてやろう。\r\nワシの家にくるといい。",
        "official_en": "I would be happy to tell you about the Ice Crystal instead, however—if you would be willing to visit my abode.",
        "real_en": "But I can tell you about the Ice Crystal. Come to my house."
